flowchart TD
    Start([START])
    
    Start --> InputLogin[/Input Username & Password<br/>HKN-001/]
    InputLogin --> ValidasiLogin{Validasi<br/>Kredensial?}
    ValidasiLogin -->|Tidak Valid| InputLogin
    ValidasiLogin -->|Valid| Dashboard[Dashboard Status Backup<br/>HKN-016]
    
    Dashboard --> MenuSetup{Setup<br/>Sistem?}
    
    MenuSetup -->|Ya| SetupPerangkat[Kelola Perangkat & SSH<br/>- Tambah Perangkat HKN-002<br/>- Kelola Kredensial SSH HKN-003<br/>- Grouping per Mitra HKN-004<br/>- Test Koneksi SSH HKN-005]
    SetupPerangkat --> CekKoneksiSetup{Koneksi<br/>SSH OK?}
    CekKoneksiSetup -->|Gagal| ErrorSetup[/Tampilkan Error/]
    ErrorSetup --> SetupPerangkat
    CekKoneksiSetup -->|Berhasil| SetupStorage[Kelola Storage & Telegram<br/>- Config Destination HKN-006<br/>- Config Bot Telegram HKN-007<br/>- Channel per Mitra HKN-008<br/>- Channel Monitoring Pusat HKN-009]
    SetupStorage --> ValidasiTelegram{Validasi<br/>Bot Token?}
    ValidasiTelegram -->|Gagal| SetupStorage
    ValidasiTelegram -->|Berhasil| SetupJadwal[Atur Jadwal Backup<br/>Harian/Mingguan/Custom<br/>HKN-010]
    SetupJadwal --> Dashboard
    
    MenuSetup -->|Tidak| MenuBackup{Backup<br/>Otomatis?}
    MenuBackup -->|Ya| BackupProcess[Cek Jadwal & Koneksi SSH<br/>HKN-011]
    BackupProcess --> CekKoneksiBackup{Koneksi<br/>Berhasil?}
    CekKoneksiBackup -->|Gagal| AlertGagal[/Alert Backup Gagal<br/>HKN-020/]
    AlertGagal --> RetryMechanism{Retry<br/>Backup?}
    RetryMechanism -->|Ya| BackupProcess
    RetryMechanism -->|Tidak| NotifGagal[/Kirim Notifikasi Gagal<br/>HKN-015/]
    NotifGagal --> Dashboard
    
    CekKoneksiBackup -->|Berhasil| EksekusiBackup[Eksekusi Backup & Simpan File<br/>Deteksi Perubahan HKN-012]
    EksekusiBackup --> CekPerubahan{Ada<br/>Perubahan?}
    CekPerubahan -->|Tidak| Dashboard
    CekPerubahan -->|Ya| VersionUpload[Versioning & Upload Telegram<br/>- Simpan Versi + Timestamp HKN-013<br/>- Upload Channel Mitra HKN-014<br/>- Upload Channel Pusat HKN-014<br/>- Kirim Notifikasi HKN-015]
    VersionUpload --> Dashboard
    
    MenuBackup -->|Tidak| MenuMonitoring{Monitoring?}
    MenuMonitoring -->|Ya| AksiHistory{Lihat<br/>History Log?}
    AksiHistory -->|Ya| HistoryLog[Lihat History Log<br/>& Audit Trail<br/>HKN-017]
    HistoryLog --> Dashboard
    
    AksiHistory -->|Tidak| AksiCompare{Lihat<br/>Compare Diff?}
    AksiCompare -->|Ya| CompareDiff[Tampilkan Diff<br/>Line-by-Line<br/>HKN-018]
    CompareDiff --> Dashboard
    
    AksiCompare -->|Tidak| AksiRestore{Restore<br/>Backup?}
    AksiRestore -->|Ya| RestoreBackup[Restore Backup<br/>dari Telegram<br/>HKN-019]
    RestoreBackup --> Dashboard
    AksiRestore -->|Tidak| Dashboard
    
    MenuMonitoring -->|Tidak| Keluar{Keluar<br/>Sistem?}
    Keluar -->|Tidak| Dashboard
    Keluar -->|Ya| End([END])
    
